{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">**Featured gameplay:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The perfect fusion of Roguelike and lawn mowing: * * Every adventure is a unique experience, with randomly generated enemies and rewards that will bring you unlimited challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect randomly dropped experience and coins, experience will increase your level, coins will be used to purchase permanent buffs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/\u8d44\u6e90.png?t=1741306990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategic combat and character growth: Choose one of three random attributes to enhance oneself during leveling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/\u5347\u7ea7.png?t=1741306990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Loyal partner: Your pet dog will assist you in collecting battlefield resources and issue warnings when powerful bosses appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/\u72d7.png?t=1741306990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rich skill combinations: Upgrade your skills and use a combination of multiple skills to defeat increasingly powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150/extras/\u591a\u6837\u5316\u6280\u80fd.png?t=1741306990\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge a powerful boss: Facing a boss with vastly different abilities, strategy and skills are the key to winning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517150